WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.988
Now the code.

2
00:00:00.988 --> 00:00:03.438
The collector makes three declared calls.

3
00:00:03.438 --> 00:00:08.213
First, describe events, filtered to
events that are open or upcoming.

4
00:00:08.213 --> 00:00:12.941
Then, for those events, the details
call for each one's latest description,

5
00:00:12.941 --> 00:00:17.668
and the affected-entities call for
the resources it names, each ten event

6
00:00:17.668 --> 00:00:22.238
identifiers at a time, because AWS's
details operation takes one to ten.

7
00:00:22.238 --> 00:00:24.438
Then the normalizer builds the record.

8
00:00:24.438 --> 00:00:28.067
The title comes from the
service and the event type code,

9
00:00:28.067 --> 00:00:30.750
like E C 2, instance retirement scheduled.

10
00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:33.038
A closed status closes the record.

11
00:00:33.038 --> 00:00:37.820
And in a live run, the region is the
partition's own Health endpoint region.
